"`normalize_robot_profile` → `build_xacro_mappings` (or "
"`build_visualization_xacro_mappings`) → xacro → `robot_description` / "
"planning URDF."
msgstr ""
"`robot_profile:=/path/to/profile.yaml` → `load_robot_profile` / "
"`normalize_robot_profile` → `build_xacro_mappings`（或 "
"`build_visualization_xacro_mappings`）→ xacro → `robot_description` / 规划 "
"URDF。"

