"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/README.md)（平台槽位）。解析顺序：**CLI > "
"profile `platform.*` > 该机 `xacro/robot.xacro` 默认值**。空字符串表示不向 xacro 传该参数。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:163
#: 968dc1c57987478aa275e55a91795eef
msgid "Role"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:163
#: 368ce768e75c49e2ad693ceca87cb5d3
