"Swappable dual-arm kit. Does **not** merge "
"`config/ros2_control/{arms}.yaml` (that overlay is `variant`)"
msgstr "可换双臂套件。**不会**合并 `config/ros2_control/{arms}.yaml`（那是 `variant` 的 overlay）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:163
#: b91021bbad6046cd873180c4f1ee6fa4
