#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Platform variant (appearance, column, …). May merge "
"`config/ros2_control/{variant}.yaml` if the file exists"
msgstr "机型变体（外观、立柱等）。若文件存在，可合并 `config/ros2_control/{variant}.yaml`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:163
#: f207795482b84f76bf84cf8d0b57c48a
