msgid "Whether chassis joints are movable (`true` / `false`)"
msgstr "底盘关节是否可动（`true` / `false`）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:181
#: 7512960ee1ea421c8fb29904888a232f
msgid ""
"`create_platform_launch_arguments()` declares `chassis` / `arms` / "
"`chassis_joints_movable` on humanoid / `component` and OCS2 `full_body` /"
" `split_body` / `demo`. Bare manipulator launches omit that set. "
"`variant` is declared with `create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()`."
msgstr ""
"`create_platform_launch_arguments()` 在人形 / `component` 以及 OCS2 "
"`full_body` / `split_body` / `demo` 上声明 `chassis` / `arms` / "
"`chassis_joints_movable`。独立机械臂 launch 不挂这组。`variant` 由 "
"`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()` 声明。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:183
#: cf80cdd3824342faaf93c5a8c43b9d56
