"ros2 launch robot_common_launch humanoid.launch.py robot:=fiveages_w1 "
"arms:=ar5_ccs\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch humanoid.launch.py robot:=fiveages_w2r "
"arms:=ar5_srs"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:190
#: aa7461a7aa824de995d8eb5f7c4b5841
msgid "ros2_control config merge"
msgstr "加入 ros2_control 配置"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:192
#: a726ba8b37d645e8ae97bb1b0dd0669f
msgid ""
"[`load_robot_config`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/robot_common_launch/common/robot_utils.py):"
msgstr ""
"末端 / `type` 行为依据 [`robot_common_launch/README.md`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/README.md)。没有 `gripper:=` launch 参数。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:194
#: b8f2abcc2a944db39c9ca1f15e946758
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"common.yaml\n"
"  → <type>.yaml / ros2_controllers.yaml\n"
"  → {variant}.yaml          # opt-in: config/ros2_control/<variant>.yaml\n"
"  → EEF compose (if any)\n"
"  → {hardware}.yaml         # opt-in: config/ros2_control/<hardware>.yaml"
"\n"
"  → control.patch (profile)"
msgstr ""
"common.yaml\n"
"  → <type>.yaml / ros2_controllers.yaml\n"
"  → {variant}.yaml          # opt-in: config/ros2_control/<variant>.yaml\n"
"  → EEF compose (if any)\n"
"  → {hardware}.yaml         # opt-in: config/ros2_control/<hardware>.yaml"
"\n"
"  → control.patch (profile)"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:203
#: 25d01e5caed642ad9f8cc8493fc8c187
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hardware overlay runs **after** end-effector compose ([robot-"
"descriptions-common #41](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-common/pull/41)), so a later compose pass does not drop "
"gripper keys that `{hardware}.yaml` added."
msgstr ""
"硬件覆盖在末端执行器组合**之后**（[robot-descriptions-common #41](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-common/pull/41)），后面的组合步骤不会丢掉 "
"`{hardware}.yaml` 写入的夹爪键。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:205
#: abc4d9f2e1b94382bf0e3cd8e05023df
msgid ""
"How `<type>.yaml` is chosen (`resolve_compose_type_key` / "
"`_generate_progressive_type_candidates`):"
msgstr ""
"`<type>.yaml` 如何选定（`resolve_compose_type_key` / "
"`_generate_progressive_type_candidates`）："

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:207
#: 0bd7c3fa1d4641b9865611184f3ca956
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Symmetric** EEF (`type` only, or `left_type` equals `right_type`): "
"progressive match by stripping `_` suffixes. Helper docstring example: "
"`ccs_left_rg75` → `ccs_left` → `ccs`. First existing `{candidate}.yaml` "
"wins; otherwise `ros2_controllers.yaml`."
msgstr ""
"**对称**末端（只设 `type`，或 `left_type` 等于 `right_type`）：按去掉 `_` "
"后缀做渐进匹配。辅助函数文档示例：`ccs_left_rg75` → `ccs_left` → `ccs`。第一个存在的 "
"`{candidate}.yaml` 生效；否则用 `ros2_controllers.yaml`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:208
#: 6673004da1284d34a07bcb9013ba6499
msgid ""
"**Asymmetric** (`left_type` ≠ `right_type`): skip progressive type YAML. "
"Base file is `ros2_controllers.yaml`, then **EEF compose** from "
"[`eef_control_registry.yaml`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/config/eef_control_registry.yaml) "
"plus per-side templates (`control_compose.py`)."
msgstr ""
"**非对称**（`left_type` ≠ `right_type`）：跳过渐进 type YAML。基底文件是 "
"`ros2_controllers.yaml`，再按 "
"[`eef_control_registry.yaml`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/config/eef_control_registry.yaml) "
"与分侧模板做 **EEF compose**（`control_compose.py`）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:210
#: c0fa8e0761d84b02becf02ec77b73a70
msgid ""
"`hardware:=` values in that README: `mock_components` / `gz` / `isaac` / "
"`isaac_sim` / `real`. `isaac_sim` is the in-process Isaac hardware "
"interface ([`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro));"
" FaSim sets it from `ROS2ControlLaunch`, not from `demo.launch.py`. "
"Overlay YAML is merged **only if the file exists**. `isaac_sim` can reuse"
" `isaac.yaml` (`emit_control` passes `hardware_yaml=isaac`). Profile YAML"
" `hardware:` (serial, `arm_ctrl_mode`) is a different layer and applies "
"only when `hardware:=real`. `use_sim_time` defaults true for `gz`, "
"`isaac`, and `isaac_sim` ([#42](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-common/pull/42))."
msgstr ""
"该 README 中的 `hardware:=` 取值：`mock_components` / `gz` / `isaac` / "
"`isaac_sim` / `real`。`isaac_sim` 是进程内 Isaac "
"驱动层（[`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)）；FaSim"
" 从 `ROS2ControlLaunch` 设置它，而不是从 `demo.launch.py`。覆盖 YAML "
"**仅在文件存在时**合并。`isaac_sim` 可以复用 `isaac.yaml`（`emit_control` 传入 "
"`hardware_yaml=isaac`）。配置里的 `hardware:`（串口、`arm_ctrl_mode`）是另一层，只在 "
